> [!abstract] **What exists.** Every physical product (owned or considered), every recurring overhead, every vendor. The catalog is the master data layer — Uses decides *how* things run, Schema decides *how to compute*, Management spends the money; this folder is the single source of truth for *the things themselves*. ~101 stock products + wishlist offers + 27 overheads + ~30 sources.

